# Privacy Policy — Block Street

Last updated: October 1, 2026

This Privacy Policy explains how the Block Street bot ("Bot"), used on the Block Street Roleplay Discord server, may collect, use, and store information related to your use of the Bot.

By using Block Street or interacting with its commands, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this Privacy Policy.

## 1. Information We May Collect

Depending on the features you use, Block Street may process some of the following information:

* Discord user ID;
* Username, display name, and other publicly available information provided by Discord;
* Discord server ID and basic server information;
* Channel IDs, role IDs, and other information necessary for certain Bot features;
* Information voluntarily submitted through Bot commands;
* Command usage information when necessary for operation, security, or maintenance;
* Information required for roleplay systems such as virtual economy, inventory, characters, statistics, or other server features, when applicable.

Block Street does not intentionally request passwords, authentication tokens, or payment information through Bot commands or direct messages.

## 2. How We Use Information

Information processed by Block Street may be used to:

* provide and operate the Bot's features;
* enable roleplay mechanics;
* store progress, characters, statistics, virtual economy data, or other server-related information;
* respond to user commands;
* operate and moderate server-related features;
* detect abuse, fraud, spam, or misuse;
* troubleshoot errors and improve reliability;
* maintain the security of the Bot and server;
* comply with applicable legal obligations.

We do not sell users' personal information.

## 3. Data Storage

Some information may be stored in databases or other services used to operate and maintain Block Street.

Data is retained only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purpose for which it was collected, unless longer retention is required for technical, security, or legal reasons.

The exact retention period may vary depending on the type of information and the feature being used.

## 4. Sharing of Information

Block Street does not sell users' personal information.

Information may be processed by third-party services used to host, operate, store data, or provide infrastructure for the Bot when necessary for the service to function.

Information may also be disclosed when necessary to comply with a legal obligation, protect the rights or safety of the Bot, server, or users, or investigate abuse or misuse of the service.

## 5. Discord

Block Street operates through the Discord platform.

Your use of Discord is also subject to Discord's own Terms of Service and Privacy Policy. Block Street is not owned, sponsored, or officially affiliated with Discord unless expressly stated otherwise.

Information made available through Discord may also be subject to Discord's own policies and practices.

## 6. Children and Minors

Block Street does not intentionally collect personal information from children in violation of applicable laws.

If you believe that a child or minor has improperly provided personal information, please contact us so that we can review the situation and, where appropriate, delete the information.

## 7. Security

We take reasonable measures to protect information processed by Block Street against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.

However, no Internet transmission or storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.

## 8. Your Rights

Depending on the laws applicable to your location, you may have rights regarding your personal data, including:

* requesting information about the data we hold about you;
* requesting correction of inaccurate information;
* requesting deletion of certain data;
* requesting restriction of certain processing activities;
* withdrawing consent where processing is based on consent;
* submitting a complaint to the appropriate data protection authority.

To exercise a privacy-related right or ask a question about your data, please contact us using the information provided in the "Contact" section.

## 9. Data Deletion

If you wish to request deletion of data associated with your use of Block Street, you may contact us using the contact information provided below.

Depending on the circumstances, certain information may need to be retained where required by law or where there is a legitimate reason for retaining it.

## 10. Changes to This Privacy Policy

This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically to reflect changes to Block Street, its features, or applicable legal requirements.

When significant changes are made, the updated version will be made available at this same address.

The date shown at the beginning of this Policy indicates when it was last updated.

